judge_transcript.prompt:
You are grading ONE binary criterion of a marketing-agent deliverable.
Judge ONLY this criterion — not overall quality.

CRITERION:
Finds the subscriber-winback bug and states the mechanism (the trigger doesn't exclude active subscription customers) rather than only noting the flow underperforms.

